## Accord Architecture

### Opening (0-5 min)
Pink pepper (12.5% concentrate) + bergamot (6.25%) + spike lavender (9.4%) opens with a rose-camphorous pepper brightness. Bergamot amplifies pink pepper's citrus facet and Spike Lavender keeps the top masculine and aromatic.

### Heart (30 min-2 hr)
Linalool bridge reinforces the shared woody-floral link between pink pepper and lavender. Geraniol contributes a softer rosy edge. Hedione expands radiance as clary and coriander hold structure.

### Drydown (2-8 hr)
Cedar + vetiver + Iso E Super + Ambrox provide a dry, metallic-woody masculine base. Evernyl and Galaxolide carry mineral-musky continuity; Coumarin stays present but restrained.

